    "endpoint": "meta",
    "query": "_locale=user&type=Red",
    "expectDivergence": "WordPress injects _locale into REST requests. Node's collectFilters reads any unknown param as a wine field, so it matches nothing and empties every facet; the native handler skips WP's own params. Divergence is intentional and only reachable through WP, which never calls the Node API."
  },
